# =============================================================================
# 1. Version Control & CI/CD Metadata
# =============================================================================
# Exclude Git history and repository workflow configurations to keep the Docker
# build context small and prevent cache invalidation on metadata changes.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github

# =============================================================================
# 2. Local Build Outputs & Intermediate Artifacts
# =============================================================================
# Exclude host-compiled binaries and intermediate files so the container builds
# cleanly from source for its target Linux architecture.
**/[Bb]uild
**/[Bb]in
**/[Oo]bj
**/[Oo]ut
**/publish

# =============================================================================
# 3. Test Suites, Demo Projects, Coverage Reports & Helper Scripts
# =============================================================================
# Only production source projects (src/) are needed to build the runtime image;
# excluding tests, demo assemblies, and coverage artifacts speeds up context transfer.
test/
demo/
.demo-output/
scripts/
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esults
**/*.trx
**/coverage*.xml

# =============================================================================
# 4. Documentation, Sample Outputs & Agent Configurations
# =============================================================================
# Markdown guides, sample generated outputs, and AI agent rules are not required
# inside the container build or runtime image.
docs/
sample_docs_output/
.agents/
README.md
.markdownlint.json

# =============================================================================
# 5. IDE, Editor & Solution Workspace Files
# =============================================================================
# Local editor settings, caches, and solution files not referenced by Dockerfile.
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userprefs
**/*.userosscache
**/*.sln.docstates
*.slnx
.editorconfig

# =============================================================================
# 6. Temporary Logs & Operating System Metadata
# =============================================================================
# Ephemeral diagnostic logs and OS-specific filesystem metadata.
**/*.tmp
**/*.log
**/*.binlog
build_errors.txt
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
